#!/usr/bin/env python3
# -*- coding: utf-8 -*-
"""
MiniCut Patch 27   (needs patch 26 = apply_26_media_preview_live_record.py to be installed first)
===========================================================================================
1. Voice recordings are saved in <Project folder (Settings)>/Recordings instead of the asset folder.
2. Media pool: Delete key / right-click > Remove from media pool (tab "In project"). A file that a clip on the timeline
   uses is NOT removed (a message tells you). A voice recording is deleted from the disk too.
3. No more freezing while many (long) audio files are loaded for the media pool / preview: the sound of a file that is
   already loaded no longer waits for other files being decoded, cards' waveforms load one at a time (thumbnails are
   not held up), the previewed file is decoded first, decoding runs at lower priority.
4. Audio tab: "Sound effects" is now "Sound filter". New filters against noise: Hum remover, Noise gate, Hiss remover.
5. Media speed (new tab "Speed" for video / audio / GIF clips): constant speed or keyframes (diamond), 5% - 1000%.
   The clip gets shorter / longer on the timeline. "Pitch follows speed" switch: on = faster is higher (like a tape),
   off = the pitch stays the same (made in the background; the export waits for it).

    python apply_27_speed_filters_recordings.py            install
    python apply_27_speed_filters_recordings.py --check    preview only
    python apply_27_speed_filters_recordings.py --revert   undo last install
    python apply_27_speed_filters_recordings.py --force    install over local edits
"""
import datetime, hashlib, json, os, py_compile, shutil, subprocess, sys

